// 1. let dates = sorted unique train timestamps;  $n_d = $ count;  $s_i$ = day index of sample $i$
// 2. weights:
//    $w_u = \mathbf{1}$;  $w_e = \exp(-(n_d-1-s)\,\log 2/(0.35 n_d))$
//    $w_d = \exp(-d_q/\mathrm{med}(d_q))$ where $d_q = \overline{((\bar x_q - \bar x_{val})/\sigma_{val})^2}$ per quarter
//    $w_c = w_e \odot w_d$;  $w_r = \mathbf{1}_{s \ge 0.6 n_d} + 0.05\, \mathbf{1}_{s < 0.6 n_d}$
// 3. for each $w \in \{w_u, w_e, w_d, w_c, w_r\}$:  fit LightGBM with sample weight $w$, ES on valid
// 4. score $\mathrm{ic}_k$ = mean daily Pearson IC of model-$k$ valid preds vs $y_{val}$
// 5. ensemble weights $\alpha_k = \max(0, \mathrm{ic}_k)/\sum_j \max(0, \mathrm{ic}_j)$
// 6. predict $= \sum_k \alpha_k\, m_k(x)$

// 1. partition train into 3 chronological periods $p_i$;  recency $r_i = \exp(\mathrm{linspace}(0, 1.5, n))$
// 2. assign expert $e_i$ by 3-way chronological split
// 3. for epoch $= 1\ldots 80$:
// 4.   $z = \mathrm{Enc}(x)$;  $z_{adv} = \mathrm{GRL}_{0.5}(z)$
// 5.   $\hat y_k = \mathrm{Expert}_k(z)$
// 6.   $\mathcal{L}_{pred} = \frac{1}{3}\sum_k \overline{r\,(0.5 + 0.5\mathbb{1}[e=k])(\hat y_k - y)^2}$
// 7.   $\mathcal{L}_{adv} = \mathrm{CE}(\mathrm{Disc}(z_{adv}), p)$;  $\mathcal{L}_{div} = \overline{|\rho_{ij}|}_{i\ne j}$
// 8.   $\mathcal{L} = \mathcal{L}_{pred} + 0.05\,\mathcal{L}_{adv} + 0.01\,\mathcal{L}_{div}$
// 9.   step Adam (lr=$10^{-3}$, wd=$10^{-5}$); clip $\|g\|\le 5$
// 10. expert weights $\alpha = \mathrm{softmax}(-\ell_v)$ on validation MSE; predict $\hat y = \sum_k \alpha_k \mathrm{Expert}_k(\mathrm{Enc}(x))$

// 1. partition train into 6 consecutive temporal regimes
// 2. fit global LightGBM on all train (300 rounds)
// 3. for $k = 1\ldots 6$:  fit LGBM-$k$ on regime-$k$ data (150 rounds);  store centroid $c_k = \mathrm{median}(X_k)$
// 4. at test, group by year-month; for each group $g$:
// 5.   $\bar x_g = \mathrm{median}(X_g)$;  $d_k = \|\bar x_g - c_k\|$
// 6.   $z_k = (d_k - \min d)/(\sigma(d)+\epsilon)$;  $w_k \propto \exp(-\gamma z_k)$
// 7.   expert pred $= \sum_k w_k\, \mathrm{LGBM}_k(X_g)$
// 8.   final $= 0.5\, \mathrm{LGBM}_{global}(X_g) + 0.5\, \text{expert pred}$

// 1. for each expert $\in \{\text{long}, \text{short}\}$ with halflife $\in \{900, 420\}$ days:
// 2.   $w_t = 2^{-\Delta t / \text{halflife}}$
// 3.   fit Ridge($\alpha=4$) with $w_t$;  $r = y - \hat y_{base}$
// 4.   fit ExtraTrees($n=160$, depth=6) on $[X, \hat y_{base}]$ predicting $r$
// 5.   $\hat y_{exp}(X) = \hat y_{base}(X) + \hat y_{boost}(X)$
// 6. on validation: grid search blend $w \in [0.1, 0.9]$ to maximize daily Spearman IC;  store $w^*$
// 7. ref drift $= \overline{|\bar X_{tr} - \bar X_{val}|/\sigma_{tr}}$
// 8. at test, per day $d$:
// 9.   $s_d = \overline{|\bar X_d - \bar X_{tr}|/\sigma_{tr}}$;  $\rho = \mathrm{clip}(s_d / s_{ref}, 0.5, 2.5)$
// 10.  $g = \sigma(8.0\,(\rho - 1.0))$;  $w_{short} = 0.5 w^* + 0.5 g$
// 11.  pred $= w_{short}\,\hat y_{short} + (1 - w_{short})\,\hat y_{long}$

// 1. recency $r = (\Delta t - \min)/(\max - \min)$;  $w_t = \exp(\lambda_{tew}\, r)$
// 2. split features into past / recent at fraction $1 - 0.35$
// 3. encoders $E_s, E_a$ + heads $P_s, P_a$ (MLP w/ GELU+LN, hidden=128, 2 layers)
// 4. for epoch $= 1\ldots 200$ (cosine LR):
// 5.   $\mathcal{L}_s = \overline{w_t (P_s(E_s(x)) - y)^2}$
// 6.   $\mathcal{L}_a = \overline{w_t^{1.5} (P_a(E_a(x)) - y)^2}$
// 7.   $\mathcal{L}_{mmd} = \mathrm{MMD}_{rbf}(E_a(X_{past}), E_a(X_{recent}))$
// 8.   $\mathcal{L} = \mathcal{L}_s + \mathcal{L}_a + 0.05\, \mathcal{L}_{mmd}$;  Adam(5e-4); $\|g\|\le 3$
// 9. fine-tune adaptive branch on recent-only for 30 epochs at lr$/2$
// 10. predict $= 0.6\,P_a(E_a(x)) + 0.4\,P_s(E_s(x))$
